# Getting a Summary Table from strace

strace doesn't have a built-in "summary table" mode, but there are several ways to achieve this. Here are the most common approaches:

## 1. Using strace's built-in counting mode

```bash
# Count syscalls (no timing)
strace -c -f -e trace=all command

# Count and time syscalls
strace -cT -f -e trace=all command
